MEOW MENU DEVELOPMENT
0.3.3 (2026-05-19)
=====
- update readme, last minor update before 0.4.x
- add --icons param to dev-reload.sh

0.3.2 (2026-05-17)
=====
- update github workflow to standardize release details
- remove Whisker's hard-coded version details
- brand new Meow icon added
- refactoring dev-load.sh to rebuild this launcher (for dev only)

0.3.1 (2026-05-17)
=====
- extend language support (using LLMs) to all the languages already supported by WhiskerMenu
- language support covers new Property and Places
- update readme

0.3.0 (2026-06-15)
=====
- Places brand new features to explore files and folders
- update readme and installation guide

0.2.3 (2026-05-14)
=====
- fix searchbar alignment in full screen layout
- fix sidebar disappearing when search in full screen layout
- update About window and README

0.2.2 (2026-05-13)
======
- complete refactor of Properties window for an easier customization
- adding simple conf files to edit default presets without Properties UI

0.2.1 (2026-05-12)
======
- bugfixing opacity issues in default presets
- improve FullScreen preset layout

0.2.0 (2026-05-09)
======
- add Presets: Classic, Modern (default), FullScreen
- more customization options

0.1.0 (2026-05-04)
======
- first release from Whisker fork
- add advanced search options

